<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom details Monday on-mkt buy back.</title>
<headline>Telecom details Monday on-mkt buy back.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand said on Monday it had acquired 511,100 shares on market during the day's session between NZ$7.10 and $7.13 each, pursuant to its $1 billion share buyback programme.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
